### Sign in (stores the token for the requests below)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.token); %}

### Who am I
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### API docs (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v3/api-docs
Accept: application/json

### Create a plan item
POST {{baseUrl}}/plan-items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Try the HTTP client",
  "intent": "READ"
}

> {% client.global.set("planItemId", response.body.id); %}

### Get the plan item
GET {{baseUrl}}/plan-items/{{planItemId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update its status (triggers a PlanEvent audit entry)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/plan-items/{{planItemId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Try the HTTP client",
  "intent": "READ",
  "status": "DONE"
}

### View the audit log
GET {{baseUrl}}/plan-events
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Is Claude configured on this server?
GET {{baseUrl}}/ai/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ask Claude for schedule changes (needs ANTHROPIC_API_KEY on the server)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/suggest
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "context": "# Planning context\n## Plan items (open only) — 1\n```json\n[{\"id\": 1, \"title\": \"Try the HTTP client\", \"intent\": \"READ\", \"status\": \"DONE\", \"targetDate\": null}]\n```",
  "request": "Anything I should follow up on?"
}

### Other collections
GET {{baseUrl}}/certifications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/study-sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/fitness-sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Routines: create one, then generate the next two weeks of plan items
POST {{baseUrl}}/recurring-plans
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Morning run",
  "intent": "EXERCISE",
  "days": ["MONDAY", "WEDNESDAY", "FRIDAY"]
}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/recurring-plans/generate?days=14
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Proposals waiting for review (what the MCP server posts)
GET {{baseUrl}}/proposals?status=PENDING
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Submit a proposal by hand
POST {{baseUrl}}/proposals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "source": "http-client",
  "summary": "Take the sample item off the calendar",
  "changes": [
    { "op": "update", "id": {{planItemId}}, "fields": { "targetDate": "CLEAR" }, "reason": "manual test" }
  ]
}

### Calendar feed link (paste into a calendar app)
GET {{baseUrl}}/calendar/link
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
